  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.1: Replace O(n²) TryParseChunked with streaming ChunkedBodyStream (PipeReader-based, zero-copy). Strict RFC 9112 chunk-size validation: no leading/trailing OWS, no 0x prefix, no +/_ in hex digits, overflow check. Bare LF detection in chunk framing and trailers. Chunk extension validation: rejects bare semicolons, invalid RFC 9110 token chars in ext-name, control chars in ext-val. Validates CRLF terminator after each chunk data section. All violations throw HttpParseException(400) and propagate correctly to the connection handler for 400/close responses instead of 500.",
